00:08:56.288 --> 00:09:00.320
<v Host>Time for a short quiz. Listen and try to answer.

00:09:00.919 --> 00:09:10.735
<v Slow>日本は、OECDに加盟する38か国の中で、何位になりましたか。

00:09:11.535 --> 00:09:14.871
<v Host>First place — in all three main subjects.

00:09:15.471 --> 00:09:23.488
<v Slow>読解力の得点は、前回の調査より何点下がりましたか。

00:09:24.288 --> 00:09:25.943
<v Host>Thirteen points.

00:09:26.543 --> 00:09:35.951
<v Slow>日本の生徒が平日にSNSを見る時間は、平均で何時間でしたか。

00:09:36.751 --> 00:09:40.735
<v Host>Two point three hours — the shortest among the countries surveyed.

00:09:41.336 --> 00:09:50.408
<v Host>That's all for today. Top of the class on paper — but the slide in reading is the number to watch. See you next time on Japanese Daily News.

00:09:51.008 --> 00:09:53.408
<v News>また明日。
